    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90728.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 7,
    "turn_text": "Alrighty, so it's February in DC, it's February in Butler, it's February in Erie. What's the climate like politically, in your opinion? Is Congress in a sour mood?",
