    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/0/90728.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Right. So it sounded like, at least the optics were, that the leaders in the House and the Senate kind of had a kumbaya moment with the president and it looks like we're going to be able to avoid a government shutdown. But as you look at it, what are you seeing there? And do you think that it's absolutely necessary to get this continuing resolution passed?",
